        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "After a devastating storm on the Martin's Farm, Bibi and Tina have to get the badly damaged farm back in shape and prepare everything for the return of the runaway horse Finja. The storm has messed things up and so the player helps the friends Bibi and Tina to collect objects lying around, repair them and bring them back to their destination.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Tras una devastadora tormenta en la Martins Farm, Bibi y Tina deben devolver a su estado original la granja, gravemente dañada, y preparar todo para el regreso del caballo fugitivo Finja. La tormenta lo ha desordenado todo, así que el jugador ayuda a las amigas Bibi y Tina a recoger objetos tirados por ahí, repararlos y llevarlos a su destino.",
