        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A violent storm has hit the area near Martinshof. Mount up and see what damage the storm has done. Ride across the fields, jump over numerous obstacles and have Bibi the witch magic away the mess. But most of all, you can have lots of fun in fast-paced horse races, show off your jumping and slalom riding skills, take loving care of the horses and send photos to your worried friend Naomi in Australia.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Una violenta tormenta ha golpeado la zona cercana al Martinshof. Súbete a la silla y observa los daños que ha causado. Cabalga por los campos, salta sobre numerosos obstáculos y haz que Bibi, la bruja, use su magia para hacer desaparecer el desastre. Pero, sobre todo, podrás divertirte mucho en carreras de caballos rápidas, mostrar tus habilidades de salto y de slalom, cuidar con cariño a los caballos y enviar fotos a tu preocupada amiga Naomi, en Australia.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2022",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
